OL,3,GNEWSAControversial Drumcree Orange
OL,4,AOrder march delayed as protesters block
OL,5,Aroad
OL,6,
OL,7,FA controversial parade organised by
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland's Orange Order has
OL,9,Fbeen delayed as hundreds of protesters
OL,10,Fblock its route in Portadown
OL,12,FPolice have called on protesters on
OL,13,FGarvaghy Road to disperse. A mile away,
OL,14,FOrangemen - who were due to march there
OL,15,Ffor the first time in 30 years - are
OL,16,Fwaiting for the road to clear - what
OL,17,Fcould happen now?
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
